  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original genus-level target anchored in photographed CNP-PIIc0440. Shell lip and slit are conservative taxon-level interpretation, not preserved measured slit. Do not borrow other-species slit length or use PRI78776 interior mold as outer shell. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"height\": 0.03804, \"width\": 0.03723, \"depth_working\": 0.03723, \"aperture_width_reference\": 0.02159, \"aperture_height_partial\": 0.01184, \"basis\": \"Ferrari2020 p568 dimensions linked to館number0440. Asterisk on peristomeheight denotes incomplete measurement. Type status wording is inconsistent with prior type paragraph/figurecaption; omit holotype/paratype assertions.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Overall height/width are reported specimen measurements. Missing lip continuation, slit dimensions, shellwall thickness and unseen interior are inferred. Never use0439 dimensions.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original genus-level target anchored in photographed CNP-PIIc0440. Shell lip and slit are conservative taxon-level interpretation, not preserved measured slit. Do not borrow other-species slit length or use PRI78776 interior mold as outer shell. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"height\": 0.03804, \"width\": 0.03723, \"depth_working\": 0.03723, \"aperture_width_reference\": 0.02159, \"aperture_height_partial\": 0.01184, \"basis\": \"Ferrari2020 p568 dimensions linked to館number0440. Asterisk on peristomeheight denotes incomplete measurement. Type status wording is inconsistent with prior type paragraph/figurecaption; omit holotype/paratype assertions.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Overall height/width are reported specimen measurements. Missing lip continuation, slit dimensions, shellwall thickness and unseen interior are inferred. Never use0439 dimensions.\"}"
